message: "If you use this research software, please cite this repository and the upstream resources listed in docs/REFERENCES.md."
title: "AFM Interface Reliability: Reliability Assessment and Failure-Mode Analysis of AlphaFold-Multimer Protein Complex Predictions"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Qiang
    given-names: Yizhou
year: 2026
date-released: 2026-08-13
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0-draft
abstract: >-
  A reproducible PINDER-based workflow for assessing AlphaFold-Multimer
  protein-protein interface predictions using model confidence, interface
  physics, ensemble consistency, symmetry-aware DockQ evaluation, grouped
  out-of-fold analysis, and failure-mode auditing.
keywords:
  - AlphaFold-Multimer
  - protein-protein interaction
  - protein complex
  - confidence estimation
  - structural bioinformatics
  - PINDER
  - DockQ
